anged`): it reads the channel's current version and stores it as the receiver's own. This works the same as `borrow_and_update()` but doesn't lock the value, so it can't block the sender.\n- **Test** (`rx_mark_unchanged` in `tokio/tests/sync_watch.rs`): it checks that the method clears a change made by `mark_changed()` and one made by a real `send`. It also checks that `changed()` waits afterwards, and that the value still reads correctly.\n\nI haven't committed anything; say if you want a commit or PR.","ttft_ms":3083,"type":"result","duration_ms":46133,"uuid":"0804c96d-4fa7-4bf4-ac85-b40b397989bb","ttft_stream_ms":2153,"time_to_request_ms":132,"first_content_frame_ms":2153,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
